# The build context of cmapi-portal-ui/Containerfile is the repository's root (deploy/crc-image.sh cmapi-portal, CI's front-door
# job). podman reads this file when there is no .containerignore, and docker reads it too. Out of the context: a checkout's own
# node_modules, which "COPY cmapi-portal-ui/ cmapi-portal-ui/" would copy over the image's npm ci (this Mac's native bindings,
# and any package installed outside package-lock.json, in an image labelled as one commit), and files that are not source and
# can hold a credential: git's own directory, the kind test's kubeconfig, renders.
**/node_modules
.git
.kube
.cmapi-test.kubeconfig
deploy/rendered
cmapi-portal-ui/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.codegraph
.tokensave
